luscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393887_643700714927943_2314168505514143083_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mDTSc7dSklIQ7kNvwGAfm-C&_nc_oc=AdoLByipKaZVnGZT4rDTZtI8wBg1b3ZzlPhDSAcvG2JDvDGmw9L27PoyK2-PP2NeUHY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS-o2_EJX5Ki6USVu6SmSKOCVygSf4E8xN8inNV_EDV-w&oe=6B0C51A2"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot06.png", "id": "1284290416010883", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391982_1284290419344216_9045095641995815940_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aSKLCyxtkPgQ7kNvwFC-irz&_nc_oc=AdqbsYwYiWL3UL2WuPjzMWSVisRuaurzfuHYe-Qht5XIT34QsDAOQV4SU06KsWyt__c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSbFoGvNajQfgPMGoo0L8Mfr_MXSqP6QPJHIdeqZqXV3w&oe=6B0C5F48"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot03.png", "id": "2057311598107878", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391911_2057311601441211_8310860660269077219_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o5RYxb3CkYoQ7kNvwE-zH0e&_nc_oc=Adrn3DmkkWFcS0jLI58-WngrG7UBQNOIrNzIcFGa2kU22X3_i3xUlpsW0Lpfxs9xkfY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRnuWkrET8vlIvkm5DN7iIfgTBg7AbI13W8-aeJ5qI4NA&oe=6B0C5E6A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Forefront_Youtube_Thumbnail_2560x1440_v2.png", "id": "1340037183858384", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393432_1340037187191717_4433184722322802065_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aee6ebdtr7cQ7kNvwFSGfTr&_nc_oc=AdoHRWGjaoF5BeUsaIPC6IOmwYFOUSXn9dU4mdIs9qnZxnKXDGGG1TcumoTrZQhIIhk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTBiY5oRe0EDwnTMSV6wCRtKWYnKtoeydYciN47d1cLrg&oe=6B0C764C"}, "display_name": "Forefront", "keywords": ["Forefront", "fps", "shooter", "military", "action"], "long_description": "# Forefront \u2013 The Next Evolution of VR Warfare\nFrom the creators of **Breachers** and **Hyper Dash**, **Forefront** delivers an **all-out war experience like never before in VR**. Engage in **massive 32-player battles** across a variety of expansive, semi-destructible environments, where strategy, skill, and teamwork decide the outcome.\n\n{1815988855801809}\n\n\ud83d\ude81 **Command land, sea, and air vehicles** \u2013 Pilot helicopters, drive tanks, and storm objectives in humvees and boats.\n\n{659860923053266}\n\n\ud83d\udd2b **Choose your class** \u2013 Play as Assault, Engineer, Medic, or Sniper, each with specialized weapons and gadgets.\n\n{978836180978704}\n\n\ud83d\udd25 **Feel the impact** \u2013 Realistic gunplay, tactical movement, and large-scale combat bring the battlefield to life.\n\n{1416901679278740}\n\n\ud83d\udca5 **Shape the fight** \u2013 Blast through walls, collapse structures, and use destruction to create new paths or deny enemy cover.\n\n{988904792660435}\n\nThe year is **2035**. A powerful energy corporation, O.R.E., has built a private military to defend its **monopoly on Red Orpiment, a rare mineral set to power the world**, while local governments and resistance fighters battle to reclaim control. You are the tip of the spear in the war to control it\u2014**which side will you take?**\n\n\u26a1 **Early Access in 2025 \u2013 Playtests begin this summer!**\n\n\ud83d\udccc **Wishlist now to be the first to fight!**\n\n\ud83d\udd17 **Join our community: ForefrontVR.com/Discord**\n", "short_description": "Forefront is an intense VR shooter featuring 32-player large-scale battles, land, sea, and air vehicles, and immersive, tactical combat. You are the tip of the spear in the war between a global energy giant and resistance forces. Which side will you take?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.triangle-factory.be/forefront-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.triangle-factory.be/forefront-terms-of-